


          Keyboard help                                         
          enter  open card            t ship card                
          space  lift or drop card    x cancel card              
          j/k    select card          r restore card             
          h/l    select column        D permanently delete       
          1-4    jump to column       n new card                 
          /      text filter          e edit card                
          f      label filter         s settings                 
          X      clear filter         a split ADR                
          p/P    switch project       i import forge issue       
          ctrl+k command palette                                 
          [Close] | ? or esc close help | q quit                 
                                                                 

